# Production environment variables
# Secrets are NOT managed by kustomize secretGenerator — ArgoCD does not have filesystem access.
# To create the shift-secrets Kubernetes Secret, run:
#   ./scripts/create-secret.sh setup/.env shift-festival
# Re-run this command whenever secrets change.
